<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Welcome to LMS</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            background-color: #f7f7f7;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .logo {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .email-container {
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: auto;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        h2 {
            color: #4CAF50;
        }

        p {
            color: #555;
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #aaa;
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="email-container">
        <h2>Welcome, {{organizationName}}! 🎉</h2>
        <div class="logo">
            <img src={{logo}} alt="">
        </div>
        <p>Your organization has been successfully registered on our LMS platform.</p>
        <p><strong>Organization Code:</strong> {{organizationCode}}</p>
        <p><strong>Country:</strong> {{country}}</p>
        <p><strong>Place:</strong> {{place}}</p>

        <p>Thank you for joining us. Let's build a great learning experience together!</p>

        <div class="footer">
            &copy; 2025 LMS Team
        </div>
    </div>

</body>

</html>